# Project conventions

Read and follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) first. Its testing, isolation, documentation, style, and browser UUID requirements apply to every change.

Follow nearby code and the existing formatter, lint, and type-check configuration. Prefer precise types, descriptive names, early returns, and reuse of existing components and hooks. Verify observable behavior with the existing tools; report the checks performed and their limits.
